<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="abt">
      <b class="mark" style="font-size:42px;width:74px;height:74px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:20px;border-width:3px">福</b>
      <div>
        <h2 class="ttl" data-z="品牌故事：從阿公的小攤車，到爸媽的店" data-e="Our Story: From Grandpa's Cart to Our Family Shop"></h2>
        <p class="sub" data-z="一碗米粉，三代人的溫度。" data-e="One bowl of vermicelli, three generations of warmth."></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="story">
      <article class="ch">
        <b class="yr">1974</b>
        <div>
          <h3 data-z="阿公的小攤車" data-e="Grandpa's little cart"></h3>
          <p data-z="天還沒亮，阿公就推著小攤車來到花蓮慈惠堂前。蒸籠一掀，白煙升起，豬油香和肉燥香飄滿整條街。來拜拜的長輩、趕著上工的街坊，都端著一碗熱呼呼、濕潤不乾澀的炒米粉。阿公常說：「吃飽，才有力氣過日子。」" data-e="Before dawn, Grandpa pushed his little cart to the front of the Cihui Temple in Hualien. When the steamer lid lifted, white steam rose and the smell of lard and braised pork filled the street. Worshippers and neighbors on their way to work all held a warm, moist bowl of fried vermicelli. Grandpa liked to say, 'A full stomach gives you strength for the day.'"></p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="ch">
        <b class="yr" data-z="傳承" data-e="Passed on"></b>
        <div>
          <h3 data-z="交到爸媽手上" data-e="Handed to Mom and Dad"></h3>
          <p data-z="爸媽從小跟在攤車旁長大，學會看火候、炒米粉，也學會熬那一鍋肉燥。後來，阿公把鍋鏟和蒸籠交給他們，只叮嚀一句：「味道不能變，料要實在。」從此，爸媽天天凌晨起床，把這句話一碗一碗煮進米粉裡。" data-e="Mom and Dad grew up beside the cart. They learned to read the flame, to fry the vermicelli, and to simmer that pot of braised pork sauce. Then Grandpa passed them the spatula and the steamer with one reminder: 'Never change the taste, and never skimp on the ingredients.' Every dawn since, they have cooked those words into each bowl."></p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="ch">
        <b class="yr" data-z="今天" data-e="Today"></b>
        <div>
          <h3 data-z="有屋頂的家" data-e="A home with a roof"></h3>
          <p data-z="一碗一碗，一年一年，小攤車終於有了遮風避雨的店面，就在吉安自強路 31 號。招牌換新了，蒸籠依然現炊保溫，熟客一進門就說「老樣子」。現在，我們也想把這份從阿公傳下來的溫度，用冷凍宅配送到遠方的家。" data-e="Bowl by bowl, year by year, the little cart found a shop with a roof, at No. 31 Ziqiang Road in Ji'an. The sign is new, but the steamer still keeps every bowl warm, and regulars walk in saying 'the usual.' Now we want to send that warmth, handed down from Grandpa, to homes far away by frozen delivery."></p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
